&lt;h2 id=&#34;dacc&#34;&gt;dacc&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;detection-and-attribution-analysis-of-climate-change&#34;&gt;Detection and Attribution Analysis of Climate Change&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Statistical tools for climate change detection and attribution using optimal fingerprinting, including generalized total least squares and estimating equation methods. The package also provides covariance shrinkage estimators.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://CRAN.R-project.org/package=dacc&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;CRAN&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/LiYanStat/dacc&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Source code&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a href=&#34;https://CRAN.R-project.org/web/packages/dacc/dacc.pdf&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Reference manual&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a href=&#34;https://liyanstat.r-universe.dev/dacc&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Development version&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-r&#34; data-lang=&#34;r&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nf&#34;&gt;install.packages&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;dacc&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4 id=&#34;references&#34;&gt;References&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Li et al. (2025). &lt;a href=&#34;https://doi.org/10.1175/JCLI-D-24-0193.1&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Journal of Climate article&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ma et al. (2023). &lt;a href=&#34;https://doi.org/10.1175/JCLI-D-22-0681.1&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Journal of Climate article&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;tls&#34;&gt;tls&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;total-least-squares-in-errors-in-variables-models&#34;&gt;Total Least Squares in Errors-in-Variables Models&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Point and interval estimation for regression models with measurement error in the predictors, using total least squares and generalized total least squares methods.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://CRAN.R-project.org/package=tls&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;CRAN&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/LiYanStat/tls&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Source code&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a href=&#34;https://CRAN.R-project.org/web/packages/tls/tls.pdf&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Reference manual&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-r&#34; data-lang=&#34;r&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nf&#34;&gt;install.packages&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;tls&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4 id=&#34;methodological-references&#34;&gt;Methodological references&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Golub and Van Loan (1980). &lt;a href=&#34;https://doi.org/10.1137/0717073&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;An Analysis of the Total Least Squares Problem&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Markovsky and Van Huffel (2007). &lt;a href=&#34;https://doi.org/10.1016/j.sigpro.2007.04.004&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Overview of total least-squares methods&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;touch&#34;&gt;touch&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;tools-of-utilization-and-cost-in-healthcare&#34;&gt;Tools of Utilization and Cost in Healthcare&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;R tools for healthcare data analysis, including mapping ICD-9 codes to AHRQ comorbidity measures and translating between ICD-9 and ICD-10 codes using CMS General Equivalence Mappings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://CRAN.R-project.org/package=touch&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;CRAN&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/wenjie2wang/touch&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Source code&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a href=&#34;https://CRAN.R-project.org/web/packages/touch/touch.pdf&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Reference manual&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-r&#34; data-lang=&#34;r&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nf&#34;&gt;install.packages&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;touch&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
