&lt;h2 id=&#34;fmerpack&#34;&gt;fmerPack&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;tools-of-heterogeneity-pursuit-via-finite-mixture-effects-model&#34;&gt;Tools of Heterogeneity Pursuit via Finite Mixture Effects Model&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Regularized finite mixture regression using an effects-model formulation to identify predictors with shared effects and those whose effects vary across clusters. Supports heterogeneity pursuit and variable selection.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://CRAN.R-project.org/package=fmerPack&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;CRAN package status&lt;/a&gt; · &lt;a href=&#34;https://CRAN.R-project.org/src/contrib/Archive/fmerPack/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Archived source releases&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CRAN archived this package on December 25, 2025. Source releases remain available from the archive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&#34;reference&#34;&gt;Reference&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Li, Y., Yu, C., Zhao, Y., Aseltine, R. H., Yao, W., and Chen, K. (2021). &lt;a href=&#34;https://doi.org/10.48550/arXiv.2003.04787&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Pursuing Sources of Heterogeneity in Modeling Clustered Population&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;other-research-software&#34;&gt;Other research software&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;paapack&#34;&gt;paaPack&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;principal-amalgamation-analysis-for-microbiome-data&#34;&gt;Principal Amalgamation Analysis for Microbiome Data&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;An R implementation of hierarchical principal amalgamation analysis, with optional guidance from a taxonomic tree. Includes tools to visualize amalgamation paths, diversity loss, and changes in between-sample distances.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/LiYanStat/paaPack&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Source code and installation instructions&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&#34;reference-1&#34;&gt;Reference&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://doi.org/10.3390/genes13071139&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Principal Amalgamation Analysis for Microbiome Data&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;em&gt;Genes&lt;/em&gt; (2022), 13(7), 1139.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
